  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>terrain-peak-snap-search · 3×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 768 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-peak-snap-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-terrain-terrain-peak-snap-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const elevationValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; elevationValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const elevationValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; elevationValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const settingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; settings: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const candidatesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; candidates: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const resultsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; results: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const WIDTH: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const HEIGHT: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const CANDIDATE_COUNT: u32 = 3u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; reduceIndex: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; reduceHeight: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">// True when (height, index) beats the incumbent: higher first, lower index on ties, any pixel beats none.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn isBetterPixel(height: f32, pixelIndex: u32, incumbentHeight: f32, incumbentIndex: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  if (pixelIndex == NO_INDEX) { return false; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  return incumbentIndex == NO_INDEX || height &gt; incumbentHeight ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">    (height == incumbentHeight &amp;&amp; pixelIndex &lt; incumbentIndex);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">const MAXIMUM_RADIUS_PIXELS: i32 = 8;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">const NO_INDEX: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">const STATUS_UNCHANGED: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">const STATUS_SNAPPED: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">const STATUS_ON_RING: u32 = 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">const STATUS_REJECTED_MOVE: u32 = 3u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">const STATUS_REJECTED_HEIGHT: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">const STATUS_NO_DATA: u32 = 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">const STATUS_OUTSIDE: u32 = 6u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">const PI: f32 = 3.141592653589793;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">const NAN_BITS: u32 = 0x7fc00000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">const INFINITY_BITS: u32 = 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">// WGSL rejects constant-evaluated NaN and infinity; a runtime zero (seed &amp; 0u) defers evaluation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">fn getNan(seed: u32) -&gt; f32 { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(NAN_BITS | (seed &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">fn getInfinity(seed: u32) -&gt; f32 { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(INFINITY_BITS | (seed &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">fn getGroundCellSize(row: u32) -&gt; vec2&lt;f32&gt; {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  let cellSize = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(settings[settingsOffset + 3u], settings[settingsOffset + 4u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  return cellSize;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">fn isInDisc(pixel: vec2&lt;i32&gt;, centre: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, cell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, radiusSquared: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let scaledX = (f32(pixel.x) - centre.x) * cell.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let scaledY = (f32(pixel.y) - centre.y) * cell.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  return scaledX * scaledX + scaledY * scaledY &lt;= radiusSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">fn isOnDiscRing(pixel: vec2&lt;i32&gt;, centre: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, cell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, radiusSquared: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  for (var neighborY = -1; neighborY &lt;= 1; neighborY++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">    for (var neighborX = -1; neighborX &lt;= 1; neighborX++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">      if ((neighborX != 0 || neighborY != 0) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">          !isInDisc(pixel + vec2&lt;i32&gt;(neighborX, neighborY), centre, cell, radiusSquared)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">        return true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  return false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">fn getMaximumRadius(cell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  return min(f32(MAXIMUM_RADIUS_PIXELS) * cell.x, f32(MAXIMUM_RADIUS_PIXELS) * cell.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">fn isRadiusClamped(requested: f32, cell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  return requested &gt; getMaximumRadius(cell);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">fn getEffectiveRadius(requested: f32, cell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  return min(requested, getMaximumRadius(cell));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">fn getDiscExtent(radius: f32, cellSize: f32) -&gt; i32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  return min(i32(floor(radius / cellSize + 0.5)) + 1, MAXIMUM_RADIUS_PIXELS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">var&lt;private&gt; snapStatus: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">var&lt;private&gt; snapPosition: vec2&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">var&lt;private&gt; snapHeight: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">var&lt;private&gt; snapDistanceValue: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">fn isValidPixel(column: u32, row: u32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  return elevationValidity[elevationValidityOffset + row * WIDTH + column] != 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">fn getElevation(column: u32, row: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  return elevationValues[elevationValuesOffset + row * WIDTH + column];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">// Bilinear DEM at an in-grid position; NaN unless all four surrounding pixels are valid.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">fn sampleElevation(position: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, seed: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  let base = vec2&lt;u32&gt;(floor(position));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  let next = min(base + vec2&lt;u32&gt;(1u), vec2&lt;u32&gt;(WIDTH - 1u, HEIGHT - 1u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">  let fraction = position - floor(position);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">  if (!isValidPixel(base.x, base.y) || !isValidPixel(next.x, base.y) ||\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">      !isValidPixel(base.x, next.y) || !isValidPixel(next.x, next.y)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    return getNan(seed);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">  let top = mix(getElevation(base.x, base.y), getElevation(next.x, base.y), fraction.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">  let bottom = mix(getElevation(base.x, next.y), getElevation(next.x, next.y), fraction.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  return mix(top, bottom, fraction.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">var&lt;private&gt; snapNearest: vec2&lt;i32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">var&lt;private&gt; snapCell: vec2&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">var&lt;private&gt; snapRadiusSquared: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">var&lt;private&gt; snapExtent: vec2&lt;i32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">var&lt;private&gt; snapDemHeight: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">// Validates the candidate and sets up the disc search. Returns false when snapStatus is final.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">fn prepareSnap(index: u32, candidate: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, isLeader: bool) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  snapStatus = STATUS_OUTSIDE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  snapPosition = candidate;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  snapHeight = getNan(index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  snapDistanceValue = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  if (!(isFiniteValue(candidate.x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(candidate.y) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">      candidate.x &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; candidate.y &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">      candidate.x &lt;= f32(WIDTH - 1u) &amp;&amp; candidate.y &lt;= f32(HEIGHT - 1u))) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    return false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">  let demHeight = sampleElevation(candidate, index);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">  snapHeight = demHeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">  snapStatus = STATUS_NO_DATA;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">  let nearest = vec2&lt;i32&gt;(i32(floor(candidate.x + 0.5)), i32(floor(candidate.y + 0.5)));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">  let cell = getGroundCellSize(u32(nearest.y));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">  var requested = settings[settingsOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  if (!(isFiniteValue(cell.x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(cell.y) &amp;&amp; cell.x &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; cell.y &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">      isFiniteValue(requested) &amp;&amp; requested &gt; 0.0)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    return false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  let radius = getEffectiveRadius(requested, cell);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  let radiusSquared = radius * radius;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">  let extentX = getDiscExtent(radius, cell.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  let extentY = getDiscExtent(radius, cell.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">  snapNearest = nearest;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">  snapCell = cell;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">  snapRadiusSquared = radiusSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">  snapExtent = vec2&lt;i32&gt;(extentX, extentY);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">  snapDemHeight = demHeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">  return true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">// Applies the move, height, and ring policies to the disc maximum found by the cooperative scan.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">fn finishSnap(index: u32, candidate: vec2&lt;f32&gt;, bestIndex: u32, bestHeight: f32) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">  let nearest = snapNearest;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">  let cell = snapCell;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  let radiusSquared = snapRadiusSquared;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  let demHeight = snapDemHeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">  if (bestIndex == NO_INDEX) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"147\">  let bestPixel = vec2&lt;i32&gt;(i32(bestIndex % WIDTH), i32(bestIndex / WIDTH));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"148\">  if (settings[settingsOffset + 7u] != 0.0 &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"149\">      isOnDiscRing(bestPixel, candidate, cell, radiusSquared)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"150\">    snapStatus = STATUS_ON_RING;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"151\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"152\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"153\">  if (bestPixel.x == nearest.x &amp;&amp; bestPixel.y == nearest.y) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"154\">    snapStatus = STATUS_UNCHANGED;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"155\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"156\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"157\">  let moveX = (f32(bestPixel.x) - candidate.x) * cell.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"158\">  let moveY = (f32(bestPixel.y) - candidate.y) * cell.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"159\">  let moveSquared = moveX * moveX + moveY * moveY;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"160\">  let maximumMove = settings[settingsOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"161\">  if (moveSquared &gt; maximumMove * maximumMove) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"162\">    snapStatus = STATUS_REJECTED_MOVE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"163\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"164\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"165\">  var reference = demHeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"166\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"167\">  if (isFiniteValue(reference) &amp;&amp;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"168\">      abs(bestHeight - reference) &gt; settings[settingsOffset + 2u]) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"169\">    snapStatus = STATUS_REJECTED_HEIGHT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"170\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"171\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"172\">  snapStatus = STATUS_SNAPPED;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"173\">  snapPosition = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(f32(bestPixel.x), f32(bestPixel.y));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"174\">  snapHeight = bestHeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"175\">  snapDistanceValue = sqrt(moveSquared);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"176\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"177\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"178\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"179\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"180\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"181\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"182\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"183\">  _ = &amp;elevationValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"184\">  _ = &amp;elevationValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"185\">  _ = &amp;settings;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"186\">  _ = &amp;candidates;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"187\">  _ = &amp;results;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"188\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"189\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"190\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"191\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"192\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"193\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"194\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"195\">  let candidateIndex = workgroupIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"196\">  let isLeader = localInvocationIndex == 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"197\">  let inRange = candidateIndex &lt; CANDIDATE_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"198\">  var candidate = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(0.0, 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"199\">  if (inRange) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"200\">    candidate = vec2&lt;f32&gt;(candidates[candidatesOffset + 2u * candidateIndex], candidates[candidatesOffset + 2u * candidateIndex + 1u]);\n</span></code></pre><p>54 source lines omitted</p><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>elevationValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-peak-snap-elevation-values\">terrain-peak-snap-elevation-values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>elevationValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"terrain-peak-snap-elevation-validity\">terrain-peak-snap-elevation-validity</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>settings<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"peak-snap-parameters\">peak-snap-parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>candidates<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static met